    "description": "The Manga Mello application or manga mello is an application to watch manga and manga translated into Arabic with the update of the chapters first, with the notification feature and the addition of manga in Arabic to favorites and the login feature to save account settings between different devices.\r\nThe Manga Milo program is fast in updating chapters and is added when it is available on the Internet from various sources. It can also be considered a manga library in Arabic or a manga reader, as it provides reading of manga, manhwa, and others. Manga melo contains only the Arabic language and mangamelo does not contain any other language.",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Manga Mello application or manga mello is an application to watch manga and manga translated into Arabic with the update of the chapters first, with the notification feature and the addition of manga in Arabic to favorites and the login feature to save account settings between different devices.<br>The Manga Milo program is fast in updating chapters and is added when it is available on the Internet from various sources. It can also be considered a manga library in Arabic or a manga reader, as it provides reading of manga, manhwa, and others. Manga melo contains only the Arabic language and mangamelo does not contain any other language.",
